{"hash":"2180981ba9114cd1b2a1b0ef80a461aac7aa6f5e","data":{"metadata":{"siteName":"eliakorkmazblog","siteDescription":"Technology blog of myself; I write generally what I learned"},"post":{"id":"da4180e5f0fe872b2395d138b10b5675","title":"Deploy ReactJS Application on Amazon S3","content":"<p>I am building and working on ReactJS recently and I will hang with some cloud system for deployment our backend and fronend codebases. So in this blog post we will create a ReactJS application and we will deploy it in Amazon S3 then again we will push some codebases changes.</p>\n<p>So let's start with <code class=\"language-text\">John Wick</code> mode.</p>\n<p>I've planned to build an <code class=\"language-text\">ReactJS</code> application with contains a <code class=\"language-text\">John Wick</code> image. </p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">npx create-react-app thisisjohn</code></p>\n<p>This will create standart <code class=\"language-text\">Javascript</code> boilerplate <code class=\"language-text\">ReactJS</code> starter.</p>\n<p>I made so tiny changes in <code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code> as you can see in below.</p>\n<pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword module\">import</span> <span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">React</span> <span class=\"token keyword module\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword module\">import</span> <span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">JohnWick</span> <span class=\"token keyword module\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./johnwick.jpg'</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\"><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">App</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div style<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> display<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"flex\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> justifyContent<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"center\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> alignItems<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"center\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>img src<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">JohnWick</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> style<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> height<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">300</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> width<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">300</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> borderRadius<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">150</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> alignSelf<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"center\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword module\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword module\">default</span> <span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">App</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre>\n<p>This is output of the website</p>\n<p><img class=\"g-image g-image--lazy g-image--loading\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg fill='none' viewBox='0 0 2052 1532' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cfilter id='__svg-blur-d392aeec8f3c1b325640aa9d37eddc6d'%3e%3cfeGaussianBlur in='SourceGraphic' stdDeviation='40'/%3e%3c/filter%3e%3c/defs%3e%3cimage x='0' y='0' filter='url(%23__svg-blur-d392aeec8f3c1b325640aa9d37eddc6d)' width='2052' height='1532' xlink:href='data:image/png%3bbase64%2ciVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAEAAAAAwCAYAAAChS3wfAAAACXBIWXMAABYlAAAWJQFJUiTwAAADd0lEQVRo3u2aa0gUURTHx/WRaWJqSGti%2bkE3tnVTKytfmRUlYWJWlihYpq1WBimaVhpkiQ%2bKMiRcUSsUhBKjQA1BFEmRQgP7kB8iK3PNx9o%2bfezsv53Rte1Bn1xt2XvhDhfmzrnn/O7/nnuZGWp4eBgTExOYmpoyap2USqGUyyCXydD2bgiN/UOoaO2FqLwBcXebIG5/i9HxScyolJiclBrdH5nOjxGJBJRSqQRN01iOIlfPIOf5ACKrX%2bNEwwBi77cgqkAM36v14OfV4fCtx3j/WcL21S6DP2q1GhRDYnZ2loWg1WqXvNJaLRuORmc/9WEHBLeaESnuwf7qPoQV1CHqSgV2lDYjIFuMjck3sT3tBr6MjrMOaozl08KEKxQKUHK5HHNzc%2bwNlvxCp6UqmoXBatv7ICh4igOV3ThY1YvQkhdwEoTC3t0HvNQibMmqhH9GGbhx2UgvrmSfoeml9UVf9DYZ9RsVgN4OY/9IYTWEOdXYVfwcIeWd2BidDsrKHhzbtbD38oVAVAR%2bSiF8Ei7DOyoZH7%2bOLkCgTReA3vlPI98gTC1kZ3lbYSOC7rXDLSKeDd7Szgk2rp7wijkHn6R8bNIBcN19FE3NL%2bcVpNGYPoDBD0Pwij6Lzeml7HoPq3oD15AYUBQHnFV2sHFYB/eDp8A7fV0HIAfOgZGoqaldVI8JA5i3MyqVgX8oER5747CzqAlBFa/gLAwHxbGGBccStk7rwd19DN6JueCdzISzfwRamltMXwGGGff4%2bVxYOrth66VyBJd3YLWbNywsbXQqoNjq4rcHvKSr8IwWgb8vFmNjY6afAwxnsLWzGxaOrhDoZB7xoAcOHnx2CTAKYAFsCoTfhTI4BseiRFy3%2bKzJ7wKGKrhyswTcmIsIv9OGDcJgcKxsYW1rjzUuXAjjM%2bEWn4eEa7cXoRkj%2bBXZBn/a0%2bJJVz8uPmqDg2/4ovy5h0QIyKpAfu0zqKdnfpG%2bSSvgdwj69vfpOdS3diEt4xKSz6TgQeNLDEqkf%2bweJq%2bAv0HQ/COpMYHTRvRjxQD8bpcJUqOh2XGZyrQNj73GDH7FAPxPRR%2bfSqUybwBmrwCFgiwBsgQIAALAnJMgUQABQACY%2bUFIQQAQAAQAAUAAEAAEAAFA3ggRBRAABAABQAAQAAQAOQcQBZgdAOZi1gCYD4SGf2OZG4AfS7SxTvDwl4wAAAAASUVORK5CYII=' /%3e%3c/svg%3e\" width=\"2052\" alt=\"Website\" data-srcset=\"/assets/static/johnwickoutput.82a2fbd.1b6f6005610510469dbec41f9573541e.png 480w, /assets/static/johnwickoutput.cbab2cf.1b6f6005610510469dbec41f9573541e.png 1024w, /assets/static/johnwickoutput.a66e809.1b6f6005610510469dbec41f9573541e.png 2052w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2052px) 100vw, 2052px\" data-src=\"/assets/static/johnwickoutput.a66e809.1b6f6005610510469dbec41f9573541e.png\"><noscript><img class=\"g-image g-image--lazy g-image--loaded\" src=\"/assets/static/johnwickoutput.a66e809.1b6f6005610510469dbec41f9573541e.png\" width=\"2052\" alt=\"Website\"></noscript></p>\n<p>The <code class=\"language-text\">ReactJS</code> side is so simple because of this is no matter what we are trying to build for now, most important part of this tutorial is knowing about <code class=\"language-text\">Amazon Web Services</code> and especially <code class=\"language-text\">S3 Bucket</code>.</p>\n<p>Maybe you've heard about <code class=\"language-text\">S3 Bucket</code> in <code class=\"language-text\">Amazon</code>. It's static web server which you can collect your datas, files, or images. If you set it as serving and send it any <code class=\"language-text\">build</code> folder it can <code class=\"language-text\">serve</code> your app.</p>\n<p>First signin to your <code class=\"language-text\">Amazon Dashboard</code> select <code class=\"language-text\">S3</code> and click to <code class=\"language-text\">Create Bucket</code> and follow the screenshots.</p>\n<p><img class=\"g-image g-image--lazy g-image--loading\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg fill='none' viewBox='0 0 2202 1290' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cfilter id='__svg-blur-f7d34cdc46ac0593b2971c58d731d48f'%3e%3cfeGaussianBlur in='SourceGraphic' stdDeviation='40'/%3e%3c/filter%3e%3c/defs%3e%3cimage x='0' y='0' filter='url(%23__svg-blur-f7d34cdc46ac0593b2971c58d731d48f)